sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title Refresh the public catalog
  participant T as Scheduler
  participant H as GitHub Actions
  participant B as Catalog Builder
  participant G as GitHub API
  participant P as GitHub Pages
  T->>H: Trigger refresh-catalog
  H->>B: npm run build (build-catalog.mjs)
  B->>G: fetch manifests + releases
  G-->>B: manifest + release data
  B-->>H: registry.json + catalog
  H->>H: npm test
  H->>P: upload + deploy
  P-->>T: Updated catalog
  Note over T: Runs on a schedule and on demand.
